loads are atomic (.tmp + rename) with incremental sync support —\r\n  only new or updated containers are re-downloaded based on file size\r\n- Helpful error on misspelled dataset names listing all available datasets\r\n- Add DownloadApi class (alias for RenderApi, backward compatible)\r\n- Update filing download endpoint to edgar-mirror.sec-api.io\r\n- Add Quick Start section, Bulk Datasets docs with download/sync examples\r\n- Add tests for Datasets, DownloadApi (42 tests total)"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEC-API-io/sec-api-python/releases/304628712","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEC-API-io/sec-api-python/releases/304628712/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/SEC-API-io/sec-api-python/releases/304628712/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/SEC-API-io/sec-api-python/releases/tag/1.0.33","id":304628712,"author":{"login":"janlukasschroeder","id":26613830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NjEzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26613830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlukasschroeder","html_url":"https://github.com/janlukasschroeder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlukasschroeder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlukasschroeder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlukasschroeder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlukasschroeder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlukasschroeder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlukasschroeder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlukasschroeder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlukasschroeder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlukasschroeder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOFm5QUM4SKEPo","tag_name":"1.0.33","target_commitish":"master","name":"Add API wrappers, tests, and comprehensive README with response examples","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-04-02T11:30:25Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T11:32:27Z","published_at":"2026-04-02T11:32:27Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEC-API-io/sec-api-python/tarball/1.0.33","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEC-API-io/sec-api-python/zipball/1.0.33","body":"- Add DownloadApi class (inherits RenderApi for backward compat), AuditFeesApi,\r\n  EdgarIndexApi, and 3 new FormAdvApi methods (get_other_business_names,\r\n  get_separately_managed_accounts, get_financial_industry_affiliations)\r\n- Update Download API endpoint from archive.sec-api.io to edgar-mirror.sec-api.io\r\n- Add integration test suite (40 tests) covering all API classes\r\n- Add collapsible response examples to all README sections with full example\r\n  response links, matching the NPM package structure\r\n- Split Form ADV, Insider Trading (Form 3/4/5), and Form N-PX into sub-sections\r\n- Add Bulk Datasets section, Quick Start code, and complete TOC with verified links\r\n- Add examples/api-responses/ with JSON response files for all APIs\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEC-API-io/sec-api-python/releases/214124578","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEC-API-io/sec-api-python/releases/214124578/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/SEC-API-io/sec-api-python/releases/214124578/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/SEC-API-io/sec-api-python/releases/tag/1.0.32","id":214124578,"author":{"login":"janlukasschroeder","id":26613830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NjEzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26613830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlukasschroeder","html_url":"https://github.com/janlukasschroeder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlukasschroeder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janlukasschroe